  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT FOR RURAL COMMUNITIES LIVING ALONG THE LAGOS LAGOON FACED WITH THE IMPACT OF CLIMATE CHANGE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address climate change at local level by transforming waste to wealth, promote better local practices in terms of water management and sanitation, generate employment and impact the lives of children attending public schools in these communities as well as support public health service provision.</narrative>
  </description>
